          "repository": "vinhnx/vtcode",
          "url": "https://github.com/vinhnx/VTCode/blob/18f7d26c76e28ab83e3de4bec4874f5fc9264190/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#L26-L30"
        },
        {
          "commit": "18f7d26c76e28ab83e3de4bec4874f5fc9264190",
          "git_sha": "876410aaafcc724688bcd43fd3d7c05575789d58",
          "line_end": 64,
          "line_start": 64,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "vinhnx/vtcode",
          "url": "https://github.com/vinhnx/VTCode/blob/18f7d26c76e28ab83e3de4bec4874f5fc9264190/README.md#L64-L64"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1c65edfad8185d067da11dd848b28ca44ecbb933132fa5e765ac58c48a50d6a1",
        "slc_54e61181b2465da6a2de2586781fe19caa9fea734278433067f7f2f5d9a48e83"
      ],
      "text": "The architecture separates the model (reasoning) from the harness (runtime supplying tools, context, sandboxing, state, and verification), organized as seven reinforcing subsystems."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6ef343e7928a4cf6ae926150393063eea497ee91f908e4d7e43fef9a518d0da1",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "18f7d26c76e28ab83e3de4bec4874f5fc9264190",
          "git_sha": "e5b98c21ae5dd89b178571b5e4f4b196c3b71104",
          "line_end": 111,
          "line_start": 108,
          "path": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "vinhnx/vtcode",
          "url": "https://github.com/vinhnx/VTCode/blob/18f7d26c76e28ab83e3de4bec4874f5fc9264190/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#L108-L111"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_be888c6362ce48c9a4412ce117604ce993e9950258578fe5f45e40ca734063a3"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI separates data on stdout from diagnostics on stderr, uses clap for argument parsing, isolates subcommands (ask, exec, chat) in dedicated modules, and handles SIGINT/SIGTERM gracefully."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1e3bec124a4f73f70cdf323253c0b20a1b3e5515deefecf78676e391cf00e36a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "18f7d26c76e28ab83e3de4bec4874f5fc9264190",
          "git_sha": "e5b98c21ae5dd89b178571b5e4f4b196c3b71104",
          "line_end": 198,
          "line_start": 196,
          "path": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "vinhnx/vtcode",
          "url": "https://github.com/vinhnx/VTCode/blob/18f7d26c76e28ab83e3de4bec4874f5fc9264190/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#L196-L198"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_8a21dd0cc1da4794db55471751738b07ef1d1679e95d95daaffbaae9d3e287b8"
      ],
      "text": "Default public tool surface includes exec_command (shell via policy/sandbox/approvals), write_stdin for live-session continuation, and apply_patch with workspace-boundary checks."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_48a6b59da80c47ab9878bd8c7835334964a4fd640576244c5919012c21f24dc0",
