        "slc_3498a156e7cdc70219eb88cbea450063f7c01fa28e3b9efca905ed94466bf6bd"
      ],
      "text": "ThreadEvent (vtcode-exec-events) is the authoritative runtime event contract feeding replay, checkpoints, memory, and trajectory export; follow-up inputs queue and inject one at a time at idle boundaries."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
