        "slc_5c5e24880780e8da23e1f5f6c55f9ac176751b31bac4ecc3e23d102692b6dd17"
      ],
      "text": "A persisted SessionMemoryEnvelope summarizes objective, constraints, touched files, grounded facts, verification status, and delegated findings for resume and summarized-fork handoff."
    },
