        "slc_c38a17a13af176c37622b47d0179249ef908d432e849934bd5130d06c091e750"
      ],
      "text": "With agent.harness.orchestration_mode = plan_build_evaluate, a planner writes spec/contract artifacts, the generator runs on the main session, and an evaluator performs a skeptical post-build pass; failed evaluation triggers bounded revision rounds."
    },
