        "slc_dbc3dd6fa979e00f0ba56e53e809b8da56dfd5ee4be2208c0616c098ec082cf0"
      ],
      "text": "Delegation is modeled as explicit thread spawning: child agents do bounded sidecar work, their output is advisory until the parent validates and merges it into the SessionMemoryEnvelope at turn boundaries."
    },
