        "slc_ef84115347a23a17659d48b19ac9448dcbbde324392e5604eac19ee3a133b5ce"
      ],
      "text": "Configuration uses vtcode.toml at workspace or platform config-directory layers, with environment-variable overrides and a legacy $VTCODE_HOME path kept as a migration source."
    },
