        "slc_649252cd18a97b668228f5465396d1a733018a244b81811c678f247d295b0422"
      ],
      "text": "Interactive sessions live-reload watched config changes with debouncing; safe settings apply without restart, and malformed edits keep the last valid configuration with a warning."
    },
